# Hai tam lon co hoc, moi to chi chua duoc MOT tam lon. Tam nho lot han vao hoc nen
# khong lam to dai them mot mili nao - du nho cua don nao vao to nao thi so to, chieu
# dai da dung va dien tich bao DEU BANG NHAU.
#
# Thu tu mac dinh (dien tich giam dan, hoa thi theo ma) day tam nho S1 cua don B vao to
# cua tam lon don A => moi to deu co ca hai don. Uu tien gom don phai doi lai: nho cua
# don nao thi vao to cua don do. Day dung la cho khoa phu duoc phep len tieng, vi no
# khong lam ton them gi ca.
